#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:85
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:86
msgid ""
"**Warm humanist voice**: Camera Plain Variable gives Lovable its "
"approachable personality. The slightly rounded terminals and organic "
"curves contrast with the sharp geometric sans-serifs used by most "
"developer tools."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:87
msgid ""
"**Variable weight as design tool**: The font supports continuous weight "
"values (e.g., 480), enabling nuanced hierarchy beyond standard weight "
"stops. Weight 480 at 60px creates a display style that feels lighter than"
" semibold but stronger than regular."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:88
msgid ""
"**Compression at scale**: Headlines use negative letter-spacing (-0.9px "
"to -1.5px) for editorial impact. Body text stays at normal tracking for "
"comfortable reading."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:89
msgid ""
"**Two weights, clear roles**: 400 (body/UI/links/buttons) and 600 "
"(headings/emphasis). The narrow weight range creates hierarchy through "
"size and spacing, not weight variation."
msgstr ""

