#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:223
msgid ""
"**Shadow Philosophy**: Lovable's depth system is intentionally shallow. "
"Instead of floating cards with dramatic drop-shadows, the system relies "
"on warm borders (`#eceae4`) against the cream surface to create gentle "
"containment. The only notable shadow pattern is the inset shadow on dark "
"buttons — a subtle multi-layer technique where a white highlight line "
"sits at the top edge while a dark ring and soft drop handle the bottom. "
"This creates a tactile, pressed-into-surface feeling rather than a "
"hovering-above-surface feeling. The warm focus shadow (`rgba(0,0,0,0.1) "
"0px 4px 12px`) is deliberately diffused and large, creating a soft glow "
"rather than a sharp outline."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:225
msgid "Decorative Depth"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:226
msgid ""
"Hero: soft, warm multi-color gradient wash (pinks, oranges, blues) behind"
" hero — atmospheric, barely visible"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:227
msgid "Footer: gradient background with warm tones transitioning to the bottom"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:228
msgid ""
"No harsh section dividers — spacing and background warmth handle "
"transitions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:230
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:232
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:233
msgid ""
"Use the warm cream background (`#f7f4ed`) as the page foundation — it's "
"the brand's signature warmth"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:234
msgid ""
"Use Camera Plain Variable at display sizes with negative letter-spacing "
"(-0.9px to -1.5px)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:235
msgid "Derive all grays from `#1c1c1c` at varying opacity levels for tonal unity"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:236
msgid "Use the inset shadow technique on dark buttons for tactile depth"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:237
msgid "Use `#eceae4` borders instead of shadows for card containment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:238
msgid "Keep the weight system narrow: 400 for body/UI, 600 for headings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:239
msgid "Use full-pill radius (9999px) only for action pills and icon buttons"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:240
msgid "Apply opacity 0.8 on active states for responsive tactile feedback"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:242
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:243
msgid ""
"Don't use pure white (`#ffffff`) as a page background — the cream is "
"intentional"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:244
msgid ""
"Don't use heavy box-shadows for cards — borders are the containment "
"mechanism"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:245
msgid ""
"Don't introduce saturated accent colors — the palette is intentionally "
"warm-neutral"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:246
msgid "Don't use weight 700 (bold) — 600 is the maximum weight in the system"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:247
msgid ""
"Don't apply 9999px radius on rectangular buttons — pills are for "
"icon/action toggles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:248
msgid ""
"Don't use sharp focus outlines — the system uses soft shadow-based focus "
"indicators"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:249
msgid ""
"Don't mix border styles — `#eceae4` for passive, `rgba(28,28,28,0.4)` for"
" interactive"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_lovable.md:250
msgid ""
"Don't increase letter-spacing on headings — Camera Plain is designed to "
"run tight at scale"
msgstr ""

